# Barbarian Guides activated during Bot1's end step: the end step has already begun, so "the next end step" is Bot2's
# turn's (CR 603.7a, 513.1), and Memnite stays on the battlefield until then. Its snow plainswalk lasts "until end of
# turn" (CR 514.2): gone in Bot2's upkeep, with Memnite still there; at Bot2's end step it returns to Bot1's hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Barbarian Guides
Memnite
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Barbarian Guides.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Barbarian Guides.Activate(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Plains)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = SnowPlainswalk
[T4 Bot2.Upkeep]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = false
[T4 Bot2.End]
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite = (absent)
Bot1.Hand = Memnite; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain
